# Non-runnable jars must never be committed into the pack.
# -slim / -dev-slim are built WITHOUT their jar-in-jar dependencies (ldlib,
# configuration, Registrate, flywheel, ...) for Maven consumers. Inside mods/
# they make Forge pick a dependency-less jar for modId "gtceu" and abort with
# "Mod ID: 'ldlib', Requested by: 'gtceu' ... [MISSING]". They are still
# published as release assets and Maven artifacts straight from build/libs.
gte/overrides/mods/*-slim.jar
gte/overrides/mods/*-dev-slim.jar

# Player name chosen on first run of the Lazy Pack launcher
.gte_username
